   ["8431"]={["Title"]="峡谷之战", ["Objectives"]="将3枚战歌峡谷荣誉奖章交给战场外的部落战争使者。", ["Description"]="The battle in Warsong Gulch against the Silverwing Sentinels is of great importance. Under the guise of protecting a forest that doesn't belong to them, the Alliance seeks to deny the Horde one of our largest sources for lumber.NEW_LINENEW_LINEDo not let this happen, {race}! Come back to me with proof of serving the Horde in a worthy manner!", ["Progress"]="战歌峡谷的战事趋于白热化，{name}。尽你的努力将银翼哨兵驱逐出我们的土地!", ["Completion"]="干得好，{class}!在你的帮助下，部落取得了战歌峡谷的胜利!", ["Translator"]=""},
   ["8432"]={["Title"]="峡谷之战", ["Objectives"]="将3枚战歌峡谷荣誉奖章交给战场外的部落战争使者。", ["Description"]="The battle in Warsong Gulch against the Silverwing Sentinels is of great importance. Under the guise of protecting a forest that doesn't belong to them, the Alliance seeks to deny the Horde one of our largest sources for lumber.NEW_LINENEW_LINEDo not let this happen, {race}! Come back to me with proof of serving the Horde in a worthy manner!", ["Progress"]="战歌峡谷的战事趋于白热化，{name}。尽你的努力将银翼哨兵驱逐出我们的土地!", ["Completion"]="干得好，{class}!在你的帮助下，部落取得了战歌峡谷的胜利!", ["Translator"]=""},
